    "missingness": "Unavailable evidence produces a null analysis component. Valid observed zero is distinct. Formal total requires all five dimensions; observed-component sum and coverage are reported separately without renormalisation.",
    "production": "Select the historical maximum among Stage 6A numeric-eligible records. Upper bound precedes lower bound; retain original value-status/year/record and metric/source tie-breaks. No summation or annualisation. Eligible positive qualitative evidence supplies 0.5 when the numeric score is zero or unavailable.",
